    "unique_elements": {
      "nonstandard_elements": "Experience centered on being surrounded by a brilliant white fog and a gentle breeze with profound peace; no tunnel, no entities, no life review. Later reports a similar pervasive peace in the room during her father's dying process (1986), and a partial visual reminder when seeing white fog at the top of the Sears Building in Chicago.",
